# oxfmt auto-discovers .prettierignore. Repository-specific generated artifacts
# belong here, never in the managed .oxfmtrc.json.

# napi-rs writes the loader and its types on every `npm run build`, and CI
# asserts `git diff --exit-code` on both. scripts/normalize-loader.mjs then
# rewrites the loader by matching napi's exact output, so a reformat would make
# the postbuild step fail outright.
index.js
index.d.ts

